# Project headers

`lift_control.h` implements the hardware-independent ME-X8/U165 controller:
0-50 mm targets, direct positioning, 30-180 degree pulse clamping, explicit
enable/release, fault handling, and an optional timed unloaded bench sweep.
Its writer callback is implemented in `src/main.cpp`.

`lv_conf.h` configures LVGL 9.3.0. `lvgl_m5gfx_compat.h` adapts its display
integration to M5GFX; PlatformIO force-includes that shim.

Copy `secrets.h.example` to ignored `secrets.h` for WiFi and both webhook URLs.
Never commit credentials. See `../README.md` and `../docs/NCIR_LIFT.md`.
